bHZ9meRaqJ9yRS5MmG6MYw&oe=6AB3F636"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "1056892768691012", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031352_1056892772024345_7144680210710675606_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S3TgmB8bxD4Q7kNvwFhXAeU&_nc_oc=AdojtPH5K5ZzeU6T5iz7P3Ef07yff5SAWfFgRxlNHbZzVt7efztGjT5Woj_hXWV4DPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKklBfLPClHtfEcCP7M9ZPahjW25gvDsR2qpvGueAG4CA&oe=6AB3D372"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Tractor Simulator VR \u2013 Farming Games | Tractor Games - Become a Country Farmer", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Escape to the tranquil world of Tractors & Fields VR: Virtual Farmer!\n\nStep into stunning landscapes, cultivate diverse crops, operate realistic tractors, and nurture your livestock in this immersive VR experience.\n\nPlant, harvest, and trade: Choose from a variety of crops, take control of meticulously crafted tractors, and sell your produce at the local market.\n\n- Build and expand: Construct barns, sheds, and other structures to create your dream virtual farm.\n- Explore and discover: Journey across vast landscapes, uncovering hidden areas and unique encounters.\n- Master the art of farming: Learn about crop rotation, animal husbandry, and different farming techniques.\n- Relax and de-stress: Find peace in the serene world of VR farming, away from the daily grind.\n- Immersive experience: Enjoy realistic weather systems, a day/night cycle, and intuitive VR controls.\n- Regular updates: Stay engaged with new content and features added regularly.\n\nTractors & Fields VR: Virtual Farmer is your gateway to a rewarding and peaceful virtual farm life. Put on your headset and embark on an unforgettable agricultural adventure! Any Suggestions or Questions are welcome at info@tulipapps.com.", "short_description": "Dive into VR farming with Tractors & Fields VR: Virtual Farmer! Cultivate your land, plant crops, and h